                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Dude, I don't know how this game isn't more popular. Super fun gameplay, tons of guns to find and upgrade, and overall just a lot of content, not to mention it's all multiplayer capable. The graphics are a bit dated and the gunplay is a little basic, but by no means do those take away from the overall experience much. I frequently find myself going back to this game and having a blast, even in 2026.",
